soko1 is the Sokoban level with the Sokoban prize (amulet of
reflection or bag of holding in vanilla, several different items in
UnNetHack).

The Sokoban branch in vanilla has 4 levels, so the first level you see
is soko4.

But in UnNetHack the Sokoban branch has only 3 levels, as I moved all
soko4 levels to soko3. The old soko3 levels still had holes instead of
pits and the level compiler made falling rock traps out of that pits
(I don't know why but it did).

> I guess you mean "upper" instead of "lowest"? and still...

I'd say the first Sokoban level you meet is the lowest as you are
*ascending* in the Sokoban branch.

